{"id":"word:hebrew:H7794","type":"word","title":"שׁוֹר","subtitle":"H7794 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a bullock (as a traveller )","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to שׁוֹר (H7794) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 79 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"שׁוֹר (shôwr) means a bullock (as a traveller ) First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 1 19."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"שׁוֹר","transliteration":"shôwr","pronunciation":"shore","strong":"H7794","lemmaId":"hebrew:H7794","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["שׁ֥וֹר","שׁ֣וֹר","הַ/שּׁ֖וֹר","הַ/שּׁוֹר֙","שֽׁוֹר"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",31],["HTd/Ncmsa",13],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",7],["HNcmsc",6],["HR/Ncmsa",6],["HC/Ncmsa",6],["HNcmsc/Sp2ms",3],["HC/Ncmsc/Sp2ms",1],["HC/Ncmsc/Sp3ms",1],["HC/Td/Ncmsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"a bullock (as a traveller )","usage":"bull(-ock), cow, ox, wall (by mistake for 7791 ).","full":"H7794. shor שׁוֺר 78 noun masculine Neh 5:18 a head of cattle, bullock, ox , etc. (often + שֶׂה חֲמוֺר, , etc.); — ׳שׁ absolute Isa 1:3 +, construct Exod 21:35 +, suffix שׁוֺרוֺ 20:17 +, etc.; plural שְׁוָרִים Hosea 12:2 ; &#8212; usually a single head of cattle , without emphasis on sex (opposed to בָּקָר collective Exodus 21:37; Num 7:3 ): as property, spoil of war, etc. Exod 20:17 (E; Gi 20:14 ) = Deut 5:18 , compare 5:14 ; Exod 21:33 (E) || Deut 22:4 ; Exodus 21:37 (twice in verse) (|| בָּקָר of five head), Exod 22:3 ; 22:8 ; 22:9 ; 22:29 ; 23:12 (all E), Deut 22:1 ; Gen 49:6 (poem in J), Deut 28:31 ; Judg 6:4 ; 1Sam 12:3 ; Job 24:3 ; as licking up ( לָחַךְ ) grass Num 22:4 (J), feeding Psa 106:20 (in reference to golden calf), compare Isa 7:25 ; Isaiah 32:30; lowing Job 6:5 ; as intelligent Isa 1:3 , vicious (goring נָגַח ) Exod 21:28 (3 t. in verse) + 11 t. Exodus 21 (E); used in ploughing Deut 22:10 , threshing 25:4 , compare Prov 14:4 ; drawing wagon Num 7:3 (P; opposed to בָּקָר collective); שׁ ׳מְּנֵי Ezek 1:10 ; specifically of male Job 21:10 (opposed to מָּרָה ), of female Lev 22:28 (H), perhaps also Num 18:17 (P), apparently Generic Deut 15:19 ; 33:17 (poem, figurative); rarely collective Gen 32:6 (+ צאֹן ), Exod 34:19 — compare Lev 27:26 (P) — Josh 6:21 ; 7:24 (all J), 1Sam 15:3 ; 22:19 ; as slaughtered Prov 7:22 , for food 1Sam 14:34 (twice in verse) (but v b read (אֶתֿ)אֲשֶׁר with ᵐ5 Th We Dr and others), 1Kin 1:19 , 25 ; Deut 14:4 ; Lev 17:3 (H), compare Neh 5:18 ( ׳שׁ אֶחָד ), Prov 15:17 ; for sacrifice Judg 6:25 ( ׳מַּרהַֿשּׁ , text strange, compare GFM), Psa 69:32 ( מָּר שׁוֺר , but join מָּר to v b Bae), 2Sam 6:13 ; Hosea 12:12 ; Lev 9:4 , 18 (P), 22:23 , 27 (H), Num 15:11 (P), Deut 17:1 ; 18:3 , compare Lev 7:23 ; 9:19 ; זֶבַח מִשּׁוֺר 4:10 (P); illicit sacrifice Isa 66:3 . [ תּוֺר ] noun masculine bullock ( ᵑ7 Syriac; Biblical Hebrew שׁוֺר , √ III. שׁור ); — plural absolute תּוֺרִין , for sacrifice Ezra 6:9 , 17 ; as eating grass Dan 4:22 ; 4:29 ; 4:30 ; 5:21 .","rootNote":"from 7788 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 1 19","keyReferences":["1Kgs 1 19","1Kgs 1 25","1Sam 12 3","1Sam 14 34","1Sam 14 34","1Sam 15 3","1Sam 22 19","2Sam 6 13"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":79,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 1 19","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שׁ֥וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 1 25","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שׁ֥וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 12 3","book":"1Sam","chapter":12,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שׁוֹר֩","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Sam 14 34","book":"1Sam","chapter":14,"verse":34,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שׁוֹר֜/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 14 34","book":"1Sam","chapter":14,"ve